# Office tiles for a community service centre and a company floor, top-down
# (3/4 view), 16x16. Wall faces are two rows high; windows, elevator, doors,
# whiteboard, displays and signs go on them.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_office_td.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_office_td_x4.png 4
@columns 8

